      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "A 1,700‑foot pier once jutted into the Atlantic, letting steamboats like the William Story ferry visitors to Manhattan’s Battery.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Midland_Beach%2C_Staten_Island",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Midland Beach Civic Association, founded mid‑century, became a cornerstone of neighborhood advocacy and community organization.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
