      ],
      "source": "https://www.cityneighborhoods.nyc/midland-beach",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Hurricane Sandy in 2012 caused historic flooding that damaged hundreds of homes and reshaped Midland Beach’s shoreline.",
